GuideME for Sunrise
===================

This mod ports the guidebook of Applied Energistics 2 (appeng.client.guidebook,
https://github.com/AppliedEnergistics/Applied-Energistics-2), which is licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LICENSE). The guide's page
format, its Markdown tags and its behaviour follow AE2's; the code here is a new
implementation on Sunrise's mod API by Joeypc6, under the same licence.

This is an unofficial port. It is not made, endorsed or supported by the AE2
team, Mojang or Microsoft.

The icon (icon.png) is Applied Energistics 2's guide item texture, scaled up;
AE2's textures are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 by the AE2 team.
